            <title>[IGNITE-5402] Errors related to multi-version support</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5402</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1) eviction policy for server and client is the same, but should be different&lt;br/&gt;
2) Marshaller on Summary is not changed when version is changed&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    on Cluster set version 1.x and set OptimizedMarshaller&lt;br/&gt;
    go to Summary and look at preview - it shows Optimized&lt;br/&gt;
    change version to 2.0 - look at preview - marshaller is still Optimized&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
